# Event Hooks Directory
#
# Contains event hook definitions:
# - hooks.json - Event handler configuration
#
# Supported events:
# - pre-wave-start   - Before wave execution begins
# - post-task-complete - After each task completes
# - post-wave-complete - After wave execution completes
# - on-verification-fail - When task verification fails
#
# Hooks enable custom actions like logging, notifications, metrics.
